{
  "id": 155093995,
  "iid": 6933,
  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "merge: Don't write to stdout if tempdir is not set",
  "description": "If merge_files_common() is called with a non NULL value for out_filenamep,\nthat always indicates tempfile mode, even if the tempdir is not set.\nA NULL value for the tempdir is handled by wtap_dump_open_tempfile,\nwhich writes to the OS default temp directory.\n\nOnly write to stdout if both out_filename and out_filenamep are NULL.\n\nFixes a crash introduced by commit 1e0d117eb7ab1ce7f4ff8a4f\nwhen selecting Merge from the GUI and the new temp_dir option is not set.",
  "state": "merged",
  "created_at": "2022-05-13T13:38:52.923Z",
